.TH KINTSUGI-RECALL 1 "2026-10-22" "kintsugi 0.8.0" "Kintsugi Manual"
.SH NAME
kintsugi-recall \- search prior accepted work
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B kintsugi recall
"<query>" [\-\-top N]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Search prior accepted work for a query. Returns the most relevant entries from
the ledger.
.SH OPTIONS
.IP \fB\-\-top\fR
Number of results (default 5)
.SH EXAMPLES
Search for prior work:
.PP
  $ kintsugi recall "authentication refactor"
.PP
Get more results:
.PP
  $ kintsugi recall "database migration" --top 10
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR kintsugi (1),
.BR kintsugi-ledger (1),
.BR kintsugi-memory (1)
